MultiLanguageSpellData['en'][1291694] = {name = "[q3]Enchant Weapon - Rite of the Hash'ey", additional_info = "2 sec cast 2\nTools: Runed Enchanting Rod\nReagents:\nCursebound Globe (5), Petrified Root (4), Flawless Amani Lapis , Eversinging Dust (20), Radiant Shard (10), Dawn Crystal (2)\nOptional Reagents:\n[q]Permanently enchants a weapon with Rite of the Hash'ey, causing your spells and abilities to grant you Hash'ey's Might, granting you 80 of a random secondary stat for 15 sec and favors your highest secondary stat when you're above 80% health. Cannot be applied to items lower than level 120.\n\nAmani Augments - Zul'Aman Zeal\nVendor:\nJan'sari the Watchful\nZone:\nThe Coiled Isle\nCost:\n150\n\n[q3]Enchant Weapon - Rite of the Hash'ey\n\n[q2]Use: Permanently enchants a weapon with Rite of the Hash'ey, causing your spells and abilities to grant you Hash'ey's Might, granting you 120 of a random secondary stat for 15 sec and favors your highest secondary stat when you're above 80% health. Cannot be applied to items lower than level 120.\n\nAmani Augments - Zul'Aman Zeal\n70"}
