MultiLanguageSpellData['en'][1295534] = {name = "[q3]Amani Cornucopia", additional_info = "2 sec cast 2\nReagents:\nUla'tek Snakehead (10), Blood Hunter (20), Cooking Spirits (8), Thalassian Fillet (50), Neutralized Venom Clot (3), Petrified Root\nOptional Reagents:\nSecret Ingredient (#480)\n[q]Recipe for 2 servings. Actual number of servings will vary based on cooking skill.\nProfession Trainer:\nMidnight Cooking (85)\nCost:\n200\n\n[q3]Amani Cornucopia\n\n[q2]Use: Place a Amani Cornucopia for all players to enjoy!\n\nRestores 7% of your maximum health and mana every second over 20 sec. Must remain seated while eating.\n\n Well Fed\n If you spend at least 10 seconds eating, you will become Well Fed gaining ( 98 * 1.1) Stamina and ( 65 * 1.1) of your highest secondary stat for 1 hour.\n90"}
